{"product_id":"legacy-smartwatch","title":"Legacy Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2 data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"119\"\u003eLegacy Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"140\"\u003eThe Legacy Smartwatch combines modern utility with timeless design, engineered to elevate your everyday life. From powerful health tracking features to customizable aesthetics, this smartwatch is built for users who demand performance, comfort, and a touch of class — whether at work, in the gym, or on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"460\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"487\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"514\" data-start=\"487\"\u003eRefined \u0026amp; Robust Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: 44mm zinc alloy + plastic case, 56g weight with IP67 water resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"587\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"589\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"589\"\u003eVibrant AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e: Sharp visuals on a 1.39\" screen with brightness adjustment and always-on support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"699\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"701\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"701\"\u003eLong Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days standby with a quick 2-hour charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"801\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"839\" data-start=\"803\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"803\"\u003eComprehensive Health Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"844\"\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"870\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"872\"\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"900\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"902\"\u003eSpO2 Level Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"928\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"930\"\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"949\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"951\"\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"982\"\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1006\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1008\"\u003eCalorie Tracker\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1026\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e120+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: Covers activities from running and cycling to yoga and beyond.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1114\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/strong\u003e: Stay updated with call alerts, messages, reminders, and app notifications.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1216\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1249\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003eVoice Assistant Integration\u003c\/strong\u003e: Compatible with voice assistants for hands-free commands.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1309\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1338\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003eInteractive Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13 dynamic faces, including 6 animated and full DIY customization.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1407\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003eEntertainment on Wrist\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in game (\"Plane\") for quick play.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1479\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1501\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003eDaily Essentials\u003c\/strong\u003e: Alarm, weather, flashlight, calculator, sedentary reminder, drink water prompt, camera control, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1644\" data-start=\"1615\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1659\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: AMOLED, 1.39-inch, brightness adjustable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003eBattery\u003c\/strong\u003e: 400mAh lithium battery\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1742\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1758\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003eUsage Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days regular, 25–30 days standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003eCharging\u003c\/strong\u003e: 2 hours via magnetic suction\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1846\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1859\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003eSensors\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate (HRS3605), SpO2, Blood pressure, Accelerometer (LIS2DOCTR)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1933\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1951\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003eSports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: 120+ activities supported\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1981\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1999\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.2, 20m range, supports calls, contacts, call records\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2068\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2089\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e: Google Assistant, Siri compatible\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2127\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2138\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003eGames\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2153\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2170\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003eOther Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e: Flashlight, alarm, weather, calculator, camera control, DND mode, motion gesture activation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2266\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2288\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e: IP67\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2340\" data-start=\"2303\"\u003eWhy Choose the Legacy Smartwatch?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2688\" data-start=\"2342\"\u003eThe Legacy \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis more than just a wearable — it’s a lifestyle upgrade. Designed with precision, equipped with cutting-edge features, and built to last, it’s the perfect companion for health tracking, productivity, and staying connected. Whether you're chasing goals or winding down, Legacy adapts to your day — strong, smart, and stylish.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gold Black","offer_id":50200306778390,"sku":"20778","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":50200306745622,"sku":"20779","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Blue","offer_id":50200306811158,"sku":"22173","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/GoldBlack_2.webp?v=1765658265","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/legacy-smartwatch","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}